title Allocation App

component allocation-webapp as "Allocation Webapp" web-application
component allocation-api as "Allocation API" service
component allocation-db as "Allocation Database" database

east thunder as "Thunder Auth" identity-server
south sendgrid as "SendGrid" service

north -> allocation-webapp

allocation-webapp -> allocation-api
allocation-webapp -> thunder
allocation-api -> thunder
allocation-api -> allocation-db
allocation-api -> sendgrid
